        {
          "text": "“Wubimiyo dul acel me apar me jami ma wuceko i poto, ma a i poto mwaka ki mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok wubicamo dul acel me apar me kalwu ki i nyim Rwot Lubaŋawu i kabedo ka ma en biyero ci keto nyiŋe bedo iye, ki dul acel me apar me koŋo vinowu ki moowu, ki litino kayo pa dyaŋiwu ki pa romi ki dyegiwu; wek wupwony lworo Rwot Lubaŋawu jwijwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ce wutye ka mabor twatwal ma miyo pe wutwero kelo dul acel me apar i kare ma Rwot omiyowu iye gum-mi, pien kabedo ma Rwot oyero me keto iye nyiŋe odoko bor kwedwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci wubicato woko wek wunoŋ cente, ci wutweyo lim meno wucito kwede i kabedo ma Rwot Lubaŋawu oyero-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubitic ki lim meno pi kit gin ducu ma cwinywu mito, macalo me wilo twoni, nyo romo nyo koŋo vino nyo koŋo makecce, ki gin ducu ma cwinywu mito, ci wubicamo ki kunnu ki yomcwiny i nyim Rwot Lubaŋawu, in ki jo ma i odi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok pe wubitenyo Lulevi ma gitye i gaŋwu ata, pien pe gipokogi dul lobo mo nyo gin mo me aleyagi kacel kwed wu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
