          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I agikki mwaka adek adek wubikelo iye dul acel me apar me gin ducu ma wuceko i mwaka-nu, wukano i gaŋiwu madito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Lulevi ma pe ki dul lobo nyo ka mo ma guleyo i kinwu, ki lubedo, ki litino kic, ki mon to ma i gaŋiwu ducu, gin ducu gibibino ka cam kwedwu giyeŋ; wek Rwot Lubaŋawu omiwu gum i kom gin ducu ma ciŋwu otiyo.",
          "type": "text",
